<title>NEW ZEALAND: Warehouse reports NZ$5.26 mln 4-mth profit. [CORRECTED 21:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Warehouse reports NZ$5.26 mln 4-mth profit. [CORRECTED 21:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to July 31 compared with year to March 31</p>
<p>(Corrects period in title and text from Q1 to 4-mth)</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    5.26 vs 23.11</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    3.7 vs 17.1</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			   1.25 vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				 165 vs 535</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 6.71 vs 31.1</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.42 vs 7.96</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)     143 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries 0.62 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 29</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 15</p>
<p>    Ex div   Nov 18</p>
<p>Note - The Warehouse Group Ltd is a discount retailer. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
